================================================================================
FORM LM-IN: NOTICE OF DEMAND FOR RECTIFICATION / IMPROVEMENT NOTICE
[Issued under Section 15 & Section 18(1) of Legal Metrology Act, 2009 read with
 Rule 20(1)(ii) & Rule 23(1) of Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011]
================================================================================

Notice Ref No: {{NOTICE_ID}}
Case File Ref: {{CASE_ID}}
Date of Issuance: {{DATE}}
Place of Issuance: {{PLACE}}

TO:
Business Entity: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
Premises Address: {{BUSINESS_ADDRESS}}

SUBJECT: Statutory Improvement Notice for contravention of Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011.

WHEREAS on {{INSPECTION_DATE}}, an inspection of your premises situated at {{BUSINESS_ADDRESS}} was conducted by the undersigned Legal Metrology Officer ({{INSPECTOR_NAME}}, ID: {{INSPECTOR_ID}}, Designation: {{OFFICER_AUTHORITY}});

AND WHEREAS during the said inspection, the following pre-packaged commodity was inspected and found non-compliant:
- Commodity / Product Description: {{PRODUCT_NAME}}
- Manufacturer / Packer / Importer: {{MANUFACTURER_NAME}}
- Batch / Lot Reference Number: {{BATCH_NUMBER}}
- Declared MRP: {{MRP}}
- Declared Net Quantity: {{NET_QUANTITY}}

OBSERVED STATUTORY VIOLATION:
{{OBSERVED_VIOLATION}}

APPLICABLE STATUTORY PROVISIONS:
- Act & Section: {{LEGAL_SECTION}} [Legal Metrology Act, 2009]
- Rule & Sub-rule: {{LEGAL_RULE}} [Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011]
- Applicable Penalty: {{PENALTY}}

MANDATORY DIRECTIVE & COMPLIANCE DEADLINE:
In accordance with Rule 20(1)(ii) and Rule 23(1), you are hereby directed to rectify the aforesaid non-compliance(s) and/or relabel/repack the non-conforming packages within {{DEADLINE}} days from the date of receipt of this notice, and submit a written compliance report to the undersigned.

TAKE NOTICE that failure to comply within the stipulated time shall result in seizure of packages under Rule 20(1)(i) and the initiation of penal prosecution under Section 36(1) of the Legal Metrology Act, 2009 before the jurisdictional Court.

Issued By:
Legal Metrology Officer: {{INSPECTOR_NAME}}
Designation & Seal: {{OFFICER_AUTHORITY}}
Officer ID: {{INSPECTOR_ID}}
Signature: _______________________________

