Officer ID: {{INSPECTOR_ID}}

APPLICANT / OFFENDER DETAILS:
Name of Offender / Entity: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
Registered Address: {{BUSINESS_ADDRESS}}

RECITALS & PARTICULARS OF CONTRAVENTION:
WHEREAS on {{INSPECTION_DATE}}, during an inspection at {{BUSINESS_ADDRESS}}, the following contravention was detected:
- Commodity Description: {{PRODUCT_NAME}}
- Manufacturer / Packer / Importer: {{MANUFACTURER_NAME}}
- Batch Reference: {{BATCH_NUMBER}}
- Declared MRP & Net Quantity: {{MRP}} | {{NET_QUANTITY}}
